    "detailed_description": "Mark's Power is an RPG with dialogues, crafting, gathering and turn-based battles. Explore the world where fate has thrown you, and tilt the cup of fate in your favor. Win over the locals, fight the enemies, and do not forget about the main goal \u2014 to repair your ship and go home! Or maybe it's worth using your power and... <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768320/extras/39cb4a8169665005a73a01a06aca0135.poster.avif?t=1751579313\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768320/extras/39cb4a8169665005a73a01a06aca0135.webm?t=1751579313\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768320/extras/39cb4a8169665005a73a01a06aca0135.mp4?t=1751579313\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Technology transfer</h2>One of the key features of this game is the ability to transfer technology, accelerating the natural development of local residents. For example, by teaching the art of making steel things, we will be able to hire stronger warriors armed with sharp swords. On the other hand, the sooner the locals create their first atomic bomb, the worse it will be for us, right?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >History</h2>Find out the history of the world where fate has thrown you. Why are the island and lowland states fighting among themselves? What do the remains of giant mechanisms mean?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Trading</h2>There is no money in this wild world, and only the objects themselves have value. Find out the trader's weakness in order to make a profitable exchange. Tip the scales in your favor!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Crafting</h2>You can use your portable manufacturer to create various things. Usually, the created thing is more valuable than the ingredients, so you can make good money on it.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collecting</h2>You can collect wild pumpkins and other resources, and then use them for trading or crafting.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Researches</h2>You can explore the corners of locations, solve riddles and receive a significant reward for your curiosity. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768320/extras/1e75c3bc876f936df5978de9c628f660.poster.avif?t=1751579313\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768320/extras/1e75c3bc876f936df5978de9c628f660.webm?t=1751579313\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768320/extras/1e75c3bc876f936df5978de9c628f660.mp4?t=1751579313\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Battles</h2>To win the battles, you can hire several warriors from the locals. Their strength depends on the thickness of your wallet <br><br>The game is easy to control and does not require a long understanding of the mechanics.",
    "about_the_game": "Mark's Power is an RPG with dialogues, crafting, gathering and turn-based battles. Explore the world where fate has thrown you, and tilt the cup of fate in your favor. Win over the locals, fight the enemies, and do not forget about the main goal \u2014 to repair your ship and go home! Or maybe it's worth using your power and... <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768320/extras/39cb4a8169665005a73a01a06aca0135.poster.avif?t=1751579313\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768320/extras/39cb4a8169665005a73a01a06aca0135.webm?t=1751579313\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768320/extras/39cb4a8169665005a73a01a06aca0135.mp4?t=1751579313\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Technology transfer</h2>One of the key features of this game is the ability to transfer technology, accelerating the natural development of local residents. For example, by teaching the art of making steel things, we will be able to hire stronger warriors armed with sharp swords. On the other hand, the sooner the locals create their first atomic bomb, the worse it will be for us, right?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >History</h2>Find out the history of the world where fate has thrown you. Why are the island and lowland states fighting among themselves? What do the remains of giant mechanisms mean?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Trading</h2>There is no money in this wild world, and only the objects themselves have value. Find out the trader's weakness in order to make a profitable exchange. Tip the scales in your favor!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Crafting</h2>You can use your portable manufacturer to create various things. Usually, the created thing is more valuable than the ingredients, so you can make good money on it.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collecting</h2>You can collect wild pumpkins and other resources, and then use them for trading or crafting.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Researches</h2>You can explore the corners of locations, solve riddles and receive a significant reward for your curiosity. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768320/extras/1e75c3bc876f936df5978de9c628f660.poster.avif?t=1751579313\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768320/extras/1e75c3bc876f936df5978de9c628f660.webm?t=1751579313\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768320/extras/1e75c3bc876f936df5978de9c628f660.mp4?t=1751579313\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Battles</h2>To win the battles, you can hire several warriors from the locals. Their strength depends on the thickness of your wallet <br><br>The game is easy to control and does not require a long understanding of the mechanics.",
